OL,3,GNEWSAFinding team member 'critical' to
OL,4,AParalympic dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young woman hoping to compete in the
OL,7,Fnext Paralympics says it is "absolutely
OL,8,Fcritical" she finds the right person to
OL,9,Fpartner her in her sport.
OL,11,FSally Kidson, from Salisbury, plays
OL,12,Fboccia, a sport originally designed for
OL,13,Fpeople with cerebral palsy, but now
OL,14,Fplayed by people with a wide range of
OL,15,Fdisabilities around the world.
OL,17,FPlayers direct coloured balls as close
OL,18,Fas possible to a white ball - for those
OL,19,Funable to throw or kick a ball
OL,20,Fthemselves, they use a ramp which they
OL,21,Fdirect to the correct position.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
